<title>USA: Shelby Williams to buy back stock.</title>
<headline>Shelby Williams to buy back stock.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shelby Williams Industries Inc said Thursday it has authorized the repurchase of up to 250,000 of its outstanding shares of common stock.  </p>
<p>The stock purchases will be made at the prevailing market price and will be used for general corporate purposes, the seating manufacturer said.</p>
<p>The company currently has about 8.8 million shares outstanding, Shelby Williams said.</p>
<p>Shelby Williams shares were unchanged at 14 Thursday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
